Description:It is your second main phase. You control Elvish Archdruid (2/2; {T}: add {G} for each Elf you control) and have Fling in hand with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-tap-for-mana-then-sacrifice | Mana abilities may be activated before costs are paid, and a tapped creature can still be sacrificed (CR 601.2g-h): tap the Archdruid for green, then pay Fling's {1}{R} and sacrifice the Archdruid for 2 damage; without its mana Fling can't be cast
